WEBVTT

00:16:57.121 --> 00:17:00.169
You pull them or you poke them.
One or the other.

00:17:01.405 --> 00:17:03.333
So, he's saying,

00:17:03.357 --> 00:17:05.396
"You're going to lay down your identity.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.575
What's in your hand?

00:17:06.599 --> 00:17:09.472
You've got identity, you've got income,
you've got influence.

00:17:09.496 --> 00:17:10.653
What's in your hand?"

00:17:11.498 --> 00:17:14.427
And he's saying, "If you lay it down,
I'll make it come alive.

00:17:14.451 --> 00:17:17.026
I'll do some things
you could never imagine possible."

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.544
And if you've watched that movie,
"Ten Commandments,"

00:17:19.568 --> 00:17:24.048
all of those big miracles that happen
in Egypt are done through this staff.

00:17:26.152 --> 00:17:31.207
Last year, I was invited to speak
at the NBA All-Stars game.